  ('art_094d0c33efc13f8c0b3d', 'hyper-saturated-surreal-pop', 'Hyper-Saturated Surreal Pop', 'Vibrant surreal pop art composition of giant floating strawberries and neon rainbow clouds over a checkerboard plane', 'Vibrant surreal pop art composition of giant floating strawberries and neon rainbow clouds over a checkerboard plane. Hyper-Saturated Surreal Pop. Pop-surreal scenes using maximal chroma, clean graphic shapes, absurd scale, and playful collisions between ordinary objects. Palette: hot pink, electric blue, acid yellow, orange, violet, lime. Lighting: crisp studio light, hard graphic shadow, luminous color bounce. Linework and edges: selective hard focal contours dissolving into soft atmospheric or dreamlike edges. Medium and texture: smooth paint or vector fields, airbrush gradients, glossy accents, subtle grain. Composition and motion: centered absurd object; bold background field; oversized props; clean visual hierarchy. Positive style cues: hyper-saturated surrealism, pop art palette, absurdist scale, bold color blocking, graphic shadows, playful dream logic, glossy object, clean composition, contemporary editorial illustration.', 'repeatable', 1000, 'USD', 'v1', true, transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), 'artworks/art_094d0c33efc13f8c0b3d/base', 'assets/artworks/hyper-saturated-surreal-pop.jpg', 'hyper-saturated-surreal-pop', 'Surreal / Hybrid', 48, 'Vibrant surreal pop art composition of giant floating strawberries and neon rainbow clouds over a checkerboard plane', array['saturated', 'surreal', 'pop']::text[], array['hyper-saturated surrealism', 'pop art palette', 'absurdist scale', 'bold color blocking', 'graphic shadows', 'playful dream logic', 'glossy object', 'clean composition', 'contemporary editorial illustration']::text[], array['muted neutrals', 'muddy paint', 'dark monochrome', 'dense photoreal clutter', 'soft melancholic haze', 'distressed antique texture']::text[], array['hot pink', 'electric blue', 'a