  ('art_4d603e11105c86408382', 'ethereal-painterly-botanica', 'Ethereal Painterly Botanica', 'Soft impressionistic oil painting of lush white peonies and eucalyptus leaves in gentle morning light', 'Soft impressionistic oil painting of lush white peonies and eucalyptus leaves in gentle morning light. Ethereal Painterly Botanica. Luminous botanical imagery painted with soft visible brushwork, translucent petals, atmospheric depth, and quiet dreamlike scale. Palette: sage, pale emerald, blush, cream, lavender, sky blue. Lighting: dappled light, soft backlight, misty bloom, translucent petal glow. Linework and edges: brush-defined lost-and-found edges with selective hard accents and soft painterly transitions. Medium and texture: watercolor, gouache, soft oil brushwork, fine canvas or paper grain. Composition and motion: close botanical cluster or lone oversized bloom; shallow depth; floating leaves; gentle asymmetry. Positive style cues: ethereal botanica, painterly flowers, translucent petals, soft-focus atmosphere, dappled light, muted pastel palette, visible brushwork, botanical dreamscape, luminous nature.', 'repeatable', 1000, 'USD', 'v1', true, transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), 'artworks/art_4d603e11105c86408382/base', 'assets/artworks/ethereal-painterly-botanica.jpg', 'ethereal-painterly-botanica', 'Painterly / Illustrative', 78, 'Soft impressionistic oil painting of lush white peonies and eucalyptus leaves in gentle morning light', array['ethereal', 'painterly', 'botanical']::text[], array['ethereal botanica', 'painterly flowers', 'translucent petals', 'soft-focus atmosphere', 'dappled light', 'muted pastel palette', 'visible brushwork', 'botanical dreamscape', 'luminous nature']::text[], array['clinical botanical diagram', 'hard vector outlines', 'saturated jungle clutter', 'glossy plastic flowers', 'dark horror', 'flat overhead light']::text[], array['sage', 'pale emerald', 'blush', 'cream', 'lavender', 'sky blue']::t