  ('art_ae2326bd33d9ebcccb7a', 'vibrant-risograph-surrealism', 'Vibrant Risograph Surrealism', 'Dual-color risograph print in vibrant fluorescent pink and teal featuring floating surreal geometric shapes', 'Dual-color risograph print in vibrant fluorescent pink and teal featuring floating surreal geometric shapes. Vibrant Risograph Surrealism. Surreal imagery printed through vivid spot colors, visible misregistration, stippled gradients, and playful flat-space collisions. Palette: fluorescent pink, cobalt, orange, yellow, teal, cream. Lighting: printed flatness with simulated hard shadow or airbrushed glow. Linework and edges: print-defined contours with visible ink breakup, carved or stippled shading, and tactile edge irregularity. Medium and texture: risograph grain, soy-ink texture, halftone, color misregistration, paper fiber. Composition and motion: layered cutout forms; off-register overlaps; bold central motif; graphic negative space. Positive style cues: vibrant risograph, surrealist print, spot-color misregistration, halftone grain, fluorescent ink, flat color blocking, dreamlike juxtaposition, tactile paper, retro graphic composition.', 'repeatable', 1000, 'USD', 'v1', true, transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), 'artworks/art_ae2326bd33d9ebcccb7a/base', 'assets/artworks/vibrant-risograph-surrealism.jpg', 'vibrant-risograph-surrealism', 'Graphic / Illustration / Print', 56, 'Dual-color risograph print in vibrant fluorescent pink and teal featuring floating surreal geometric shapes', array['vibrant', 'risograph', 'surreal']::text[], array['vibrant risograph', 'surrealist print', 'spot-color misregistration', 'halftone grain', 'fluorescent ink', 'flat color blocking', 'dreamlike juxtaposition', 'tactile paper', 'retro graphic composition']::text[], array['photorealism', 'smooth digital gradients', 'metallic 3D', 'subdued monochrome', 'precise registration', 'glossy magazine finish']::text[], array['fluorescent pink', 'coba