  ('art_bc8268a8e110d051c958', 'graphic-surreal-pop', 'Graphic Surreal Pop', 'Graphic pop art illustration featuring a surreal floating eyeball inside a melting ice cream cone against a bold striped background', 'Graphic pop art illustration featuring a surreal floating eyeball inside a melting ice cream cone against a bold striped background. Graphic Surreal Pop. Clean, bold, flat-color illustration where everyday objects and figures are recombined through playful surreal logic. Palette: primary red, cobalt, yellow, black, cream, pink accent. Lighting: flat graphic light, crisp hard shadow, occasional gradient glow. Linework and edges: print-defined contours with visible ink breakup, carved or stippled shading, and tactile edge irregularity. Medium and texture: vector-like shapes, screenprint grain, smooth matte color. Composition and motion: centered conceptual object; oversized prop; cutaway or impossible transformation; clear hierarchy. Positive style cues: graphic surreal pop, flat vector illustration, bold color blocking, playful absurdism, clean hard-edged shapes, conceptual composition, pop-art palette, minimalist dream logic, editorial illustration.', 'repeatable', 1000, 'USD', 'v1', true, transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), transaction_timestamp(), 'artworks/art_bc8268a8e110d051c958/base', 'assets/artworks/graphic-surreal-pop.jpg', 'graphic-surreal-pop', 'Graphic / Illustration / Print', 98, 'Graphic pop art illustration featuring a surreal floating eyeball inside a melting ice cream cone against a bold striped background', array['bold', 'pop', 'surreal']::text[], array['graphic surreal pop', 'flat vector illustration', 'bold color blocking', 'playful absurdism', 'clean hard-edged shapes', 'conceptual composition', 'pop-art palette', 'minimalist dream logic', 'editorial illustration']::text[], array['photorealistic clutter', 'dark gritty texture', 'subtle beige minimalism', 'ornate painterly detail', 'atmospheric fog', 'weak focal point']::te